REQUEST_VERSION 1.0.0

ID REQUEST-0019

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-27

WHO President Cley Duarte

SCOPE PACE

TITLE

Keeping the external task tracker (ClickUp) in sync with the roadmap must
be an enforced rule the user can establish - not something that depends on
the AI remembering. Forgetting it is PACE failing.

RAW_TEXT

Sino te acordaste de clickup Pace esta fallando esto lo puede establecer el
usuario y se debe cumplir.

PROPOSED_SCOPE PACE

DESIGN_NOTE

Same failure class as REQUEST-0016 (chat is not memory): the AI had to be
reminded to update ClickUp, so the obligation lived only in the AI's
diligence, not in an enforced rule. Immediate remedy: RULE-0010 (the
tracker mirrors the roadmap, updated in the same turn a roadmap item
changes). Product remedy: a real ClickUp/GitHub integration so PACE can
DETECT and flag tracker drift automatically.

PROMOTED_TO

RULE-0010 (in force) + future ClickUp/GitHub sync integration

APPROVED_BY

President Cley Duarte

END
